WEBVTT

01:33.270 --> 01:34.230
What?! What's happened?!

01:37.370 --> 01:39.470
It's a spaceship from the planet Sharak.

01:39.470 --> 01:40.450
Another one?

01:40.450 --> 01:44.800
Somehow, we've become used to situations like this, haven't we?

01:48.710 --> 01:50.460
So, what kind of visitor have we got this time?

02:12.430 --> 02:14.190
Here's my identification.

02:14.190 --> 02:19.240
Teru of Planet Sharak Visits

02:19.700 --> 02:23.650
Oh! That's the Galaxy Police's emblem!

02:23.650 --> 02:24.280
What?

02:24.590 --> 02:25.080
What?

02:25.080 --> 02:27.060
He's a detective.

02:27.060 --> 02:28.480
A detective?

02:28.480 --> 02:29.530
Yes, that's correct.

02:31.730 --> 02:33.940
What? Isn't that Rui-san?

02:34.750 --> 02:37.930
Yaboshi Rui-san from the planet Sharak is staying with you, correct?

02:37.930 --> 02:40.310
Detective, why are you looking for Rui-san?

02:40.310 --> 02:42.550
Is she in some kind of trouble?

02:42.550 --> 02:44.260
Rui-san isn't here.

02:44.560 --> 02:45.850
It's no use acting dumb!

02:50.740 --> 02:52.150
Oh, my...

02:52.150 --> 02:53.490
Rui-san?!

02:53.490 --> 02:54.360
Hi!

02:54.940 --> 02:55.980
What?!

02:55.980 --> 02:57.670
Rui!

02:57.670 --> 02:58.500
Don't come near me!

03:00.360 --> 03:01.910
Understood...

03:07.930 --> 03:10.450
Greetings! I apologize for not introducing myself earlier.

03:10.450 --> 03:15.220
I'm the rising young hot-blooded detective of the Galaxy Police, Moroboshi Teru.

03:15.220 --> 03:16.130
Pleased to meet you.

03:16.130 --> 03:17.220
I see...

03:17.220 --> 03:18.510
Nice to meet you...

03:20.490 --> 03:24.350
I've already heard a lot about you from Rui and Seiya-kun.

03:24.350 --> 03:25.940
I'm so happy I finally met you.

03:27.140 --> 03:31.020
So, I'm correct in thinking that Rui-san isn't in any trouble,

03:31.020 --> 03:34.050
and that you two know each other, right?

03:34.050 --> 03:36.480
No, we're not just<i> friends.</i>

03:36.720 --> 03:39.170
We're in love; we're a couple.

03:39.170 --> 03:40.500
Wrong!

03:40.500 --> 03:42.950
We've already broken up!

03:43.260 --> 03:44.410
Now, now...

03:44.670 --> 03:47.820
Besides, Teru, how did you manage to find this place?

03:48.960 --> 03:51.800
Well, you said it yourself.

03:51.800 --> 03:55.420
I'm heading to Saionji-san's place on Earth, so don't even think about following me!

03:56.420 --> 03:57.860
Damn!

03:57.860 --> 04:00.660
Jeez, I can't believe that you followed me here!

04:01.430 --> 04:05.870
Um... aren't you the one who followed him, Rui-san?

04:05.870 --> 04:06.890
You're mistaken.

04:07.190 --> 04:11.530
That's right, Teru-san was looking for Rui-san... Huh?

04:11.530 --> 04:13.880
But why was he here before you, Rui-san?

04:13.880 --> 04:17.730
He just blindly rushes forward in a straight line once he's convinced of something, so...

04:17.730 --> 04:21.660
Wait, Rui!

04:22.350 --> 04:24.280
I'm almost positive that's what happened.

04:24.280 --> 04:25.790
I see...

04:25.790 --> 04:27.670
He definitely does blindly rush forward...

04:29.950 --> 04:32.750
Anyway, just go home already!

04:34.270 --> 04:37.060
Rui, there's no need to blush so much.

04:37.060 --> 04:38.510
Who's blushing?!

04:38.510 --> 04:41.080
I don't want to see your face!

04:42.230 --> 04:43.880
But you want to hear my voice, right?

04:50.260 --> 04:51.310
You're such a sweetie pie.

04:54.580 --> 04:56.020
Calm down, Rui-san.

04:56.020 --> 04:56.940
Yup, yup.

04:56.940 --> 05:00.230
I know, how about we just forget about it for today and discuss it more tomorrow?

05:00.230 --> 05:03.740
Either way, it's better if everyone is calm.

05:04.150 --> 05:07.000
You're right, otherwise I'll just be a nuisance to you all.

05:07.000 --> 05:08.520
Well then, I'll show you to your rooms.

05:08.520 --> 05:11.620
Don't worry, I'll sleep in my spaceship.

05:14.780 --> 05:17.930
Teru, make sure you don't cross this line, understand?

05:18.900 --> 05:21.410
Alas, there's a wall between us...

05:21.410 --> 05:24.890
A heartless wall that separates two lovers!

05:24.890 --> 05:26.960
Furthermore, it's narrow.

05:27.340 --> 05:31.250
Rui! Come back!

05:31.250 --> 05:32.660
This is intolerable.

05:32.660 --> 05:34.000
Anyway, let's just go back to sleep for now.

05:34.000 --> 05:37.310
I'd be so happy to find that this is all just a dream in the morning...

05:37.310 --> 05:41.230
Rui!

05:51.080 --> 05:53.200
Now, everyone, let's all merrily wake up!

05:55.700 --> 05:58.160
The secret to healthiness is an early morning jog!

05:58.160 --> 06:00.670
Now, let's all run together for our tomorrow!

06:00.670 --> 06:06.670
We'll shed the sweat of youth and turn into a refreshing wind!

06:06.670 --> 06:08.350
Shut up! You're being a nuisance!

06:08.350 --> 06:09.840
You'll wake everyone up!

06:10.150 --> 06:12.290
We're already awake...

06:12.290 --> 06:14.680
And our long-awaited Sunday is finally here too...

06:14.680 --> 06:17.500
So, it wasn't a dream after all...

06:27.400 --> 06:29.140
You're doing pretty well there, Pepo-kun.

06:29.140 --> 06:30.580
I won't lose to you either!

06:31.810 --> 06:33.250
It's fine to lose...

06:33.250 --> 06:34.870
He's so childish...

06:35.630 --> 06:38.080
How about you be a bit more polite?!

06:38.080 --> 06:40.340
We've run out of rice already...

06:40.340 --> 06:43.710
Is this how we're going to have to live from now on?

06:43.710 --> 06:46.590
Somehow, we're going to have to get them to leave

06:46.590 --> 06:48.670
or there won't be any peace in the Saionji household.

06:49.020 --> 06:51.950
But how do we convince them to go home?

06:51.950 --> 06:56.560
Let's try finding out why she left in the first place.

07:01.170 --> 07:04.200
Doing things like this now and then is rather fun.

07:05.250 --> 07:07.150
Um, Rui-san?

07:07.510 --> 07:08.450
Yes?

07:08.450 --> 07:10.010
Well, um...

07:10.010 --> 07:12.030
What is it? What would you like to ask me?

07:13.480 --> 07:16.000
As I thought, it's kind of hard to bring up the topic...

07:16.000 --> 07:18.900
Oh, that's right, Miyu-chan, can you just hear me out?

07:18.900 --> 07:19.520
What?

07:19.520 --> 07:21.210
Teru's just so awful!

07:21.210 --> 07:25.710
He's just so rude and he's so thick-skinned!

07:25.710 --> 07:27.400
He's always trying to cheer up people for no reason whatsoever,

07:27.400 --> 07:29.830
and just rubs me in all the wrong ways!

07:29.830 --> 07:32.260
He's always dashing around; he just doesn't know when to stop!

07:32.260 --> 07:33.180
I-I see...

07:33.450 --> 07:36.720
The other day, I just remarked that I wished I could eat some pudding...

07:42.050 --> 07:46.190
Here's three months' paycheck's worth of pudding. Eat your heart out!

07:46.190 --> 07:52.650
Since he did buy them for me and I hate wasting food, I ate them,

07:52.650 --> 07:55.200
but no matter how much I ate, the number of puddings just didn't seem to decrease.

07:55.200 --> 08:00.150
My weight kept increasing and I began to have nightmares about drowning in pudding...

08:00.150 --> 08:02.960
Then when I finally ate them all...

08:02.960 --> 08:04.340
So you managed to eat them all...

08:04.340 --> 08:07.000
At this fancy all-you-can-eat restaurant we went to yesterday...

08:13.700 --> 08:15.770
Now, eat your heart out!

08:20.730 --> 08:21.660
Teru...

08:24.770 --> 08:27.720
No! Your body fat percentage has increased!

08:27.730 --> 08:30.690
[Note: The arrow reads "Gotten fatter."]

08:27.870 --> 08:29.170
You've gotten fatter!

08:29.170 --> 08:30.690
You've become a hidden obese...

08:30.690 --> 08:32.950
A hidden obese...

08:32.950 --> 08:36.160
This is so odd. I wonder how it happened...

08:36.160 --> 08:38.370
Whose fault do you think this is in the first place?!

08:38.370 --> 08:40.630
That's what happened.

08:40.630 --> 08:42.620
Oh man...

08:42.620 --> 08:44.750
He does it all the time.

08:44.750 --> 08:50.180
We joined the Galaxy Police at the same time and we sort of started going out, but...

08:50.180 --> 08:53.210
I just couldn't stand it anymore!

08:53.880 --> 08:55.270
So, I told him directly that I was breaking up with him,

08:55.270 --> 08:57.420
but he didn't understand and continued being his usual self...

08:58.830 --> 09:00.220
What a wonderful joke!

09:00.220 --> 09:01.730
He just refuses to listen to me.

09:01.730 --> 09:03.890
Is that why you ran away?

09:03.890 --> 09:06.810
Yup, but he followed me here anyway.

09:06.810 --> 09:08.020
He's just awful!

09:08.020 --> 09:11.300
Not only does he ignore people's feelings, but he's so obstinate too!

09:11.300 --> 09:12.690
I just can't forgive him either!

09:12.950 --> 09:15.320
Oh, that story sounded really interesting.

09:15.320 --> 09:18.320
[Note: Idea]

09:15.630 --> 09:16.910
Oh, Mikan-san.

09:16.910 --> 09:18.670
Long time no see.

09:19.260 --> 09:21.770
Hey, do you remember the last time I interviewed you,

09:21.770 --> 09:23.550
you told me a story about an enemy you had who turned out to be your brother?

09:23.550 --> 09:28.100
It was really popular and as a result I came first in a reader's poll.

09:28.100 --> 09:30.210
So, this time you have a tale about troubled love?

09:30.210 --> 09:31.370
A tale about stalkers?

09:31.370 --> 09:32.450
I like it! I like it!

09:32.450 --> 09:33.210
It's scary!

09:33.570 --> 09:35.620
Please let me interview you in more detail.

09:38.010 --> 09:41.400
Ruu-chama! Ruu-chama! Where are you?

09:47.980 --> 09:50.060
If you don't hurry and run away, I'll catch you.

09:51.650 --> 09:53.700
Oh, so he was playing with them.

09:53.700 --> 09:57.680
Ruu-chama and Pepo both seem to be having a lot of fun.

09:57.680 --> 09:59.770
He may be an unexpectedly nice person after all.

09:59.770 --> 10:00.830
Wanya.

10:02.560 --> 10:05.950
I see, so she seriously wants to break up with him...

10:05.950 --> 10:10.750
Yeah, Rui-san's troubled because he refuses to break up with her no matter what she says.

10:10.750 --> 10:12.720
What about Rui?!

10:12.720 --> 10:14.450
Ah! It's nothing!

10:14.970 --> 10:18.130
Rui's not here?! Didn't she leave to hang the laundry?!

10:18.130 --> 10:20.220
Rui!

10:20.220 --> 10:23.090
U-Um, please calm down and listen.

10:23.090 --> 10:26.100
She's just visiting a neighbor.

10:26.100 --> 10:28.060
Oh, is that all?

10:28.060 --> 10:32.640
I came here without asking for permission to have the day off, so I'll need to head back home soon,

10:32.640 --> 10:35.340
but when I do, Rui will be coming with me.

10:35.340 --> 10:38.610
Oh, but I'll wait until after lunch.

10:39.490 --> 10:42.160
So you're planning to eat lunch with us...

10:43.970 --> 10:45.920
Okay, I've got it. Let's go.

10:45.920 --> 10:48.270
Well, please let me know when Rui's back.

10:48.270 --> 10:49.430
It's a promise, okay?

10:50.950 --> 10:55.590
Though he's actually quite a nice person, since he's willing to play with Ruu-chama and Pepo...

10:55.590 --> 10:59.020
But it's also a fact that Rui-san is troubled.

10:59.020 --> 11:05.060
We need him to understand that he's been dumped by Rui-san, or I'll feel sorry for her.

11:05.060 --> 11:09.570
So, let's tell Teru-san the truth straight away and ask him to leave.

11:09.570 --> 11:10.800
What are you talking about?

11:10.800 --> 11:12.440
Oh, Kanata, you can help us too.

11:14.720 --> 11:15.900
Don't.

11:15.900 --> 11:17.260
What? But why?

11:17.260 --> 11:20.290
Kanata, you do want them to leave as soon as possible, right?

11:20.290 --> 11:23.130
Well, yes, but we don't exactly know their true circumstances

11:23.130 --> 11:25.700
by just listening to what they have to say, right?

11:25.700 --> 11:28.950
You're meddlesome and easily jump to conclusions.

11:29.270 --> 11:30.570
What did you just say?!

11:30.570 --> 11:34.670
When exactly have I been meddlesome and jumped to conclusions?!

11:34.670 --> 11:36.460
Actually, you do it quite often.

11:36.700 --> 11:41.440
How rude. Why are you always so bossy, Kanata?

11:41.440 --> 11:45.280
Bossy? I'm merely stating the obvious.

11:45.280 --> 11:48.050
The way you're talking right now is exactly what I mean by bossy!

11:48.430 --> 11:51.890
Now, please don't fight as well.

11:52.310 --> 11:55.750
If you don't hurry up and finish hanging the laundry, it's going to be wrinkled.

11:57.630 --> 12:02.150
He acts bossy just because he's older by 2 months and 21 days!

12:02.150 --> 12:04.410
Fine, I won't rely on you, Kanata.

12:04.790 --> 12:05.770
Wanya.

12:05.770 --> 12:06.470
Yes?

12:06.470 --> 12:10.790
We're going to make Teru-san go home, no matter what.

12:19.130 --> 12:20.550
This is a free fansub. Not for sale or rent.

12:20.550 --> 12:22.630
[Note: Sign says "Hanakomachi Residence: House of Candy."]

12:24.340 --> 12:30.510
Ah, it's that moment in the afternoon when it's sweet yet a little sour and melting like apple pie.

12:31.330 --> 12:33.460
It's an apple pie shaped like Kanata-kun's face.

12:33.460 --> 12:38.270
My, I'm so romantic, so beautiful, so bold!

12:40.080 --> 12:42.110
Ruu-kun, you're "it" next.

12:45.600 --> 12:46.930
Okay! We're going to do this.

12:46.930 --> 12:48.770
How?

12:48.770 --> 12:52.350
We're going to get right to the point and just tell him bluntly.

12:52.350 --> 12:53.000
Teru-san!

12:53.000 --> 12:55.250
My darling Ruu!

12:58.060 --> 13:00.530
Ruu-kun, is this your lovey-dovey girlfriend?

13:00.530 --> 13:02.720
Hello, Mister, I don't think we've met.

13:04.360 --> 13:07.370
I'm the rising young hot-blooded detective of the Galaxy Police, Moroboshi Teru.

13:07.370 --> 13:08.800
And he's actually...

13:09.260 --> 13:12.240
Little girl, I don't know if you know this,

13:12.240 --> 13:15.600
but I'm the lovey-dovey boyfriend of the extremely cute Yaboshi Rui-chan.

13:15.940 --> 13:16.770
Rui Rui's?

13:17.230 --> 13:18.190
No, you're not!

13:19.120 --> 13:23.030
Momoka-chan, this is Rui-san's ex<i>-boyfriend.</i>

13:23.030 --> 13:24.050
Ex?

13:25.280 --> 13:27.350
What are you talking about, Miyu-kun?

13:27.350 --> 13:31.900
Rui and I are really good together; we're in love.

13:31.900 --> 13:36.020
You know, you're the only one who thinks that, Teru-san.

13:36.020 --> 13:41.420
Rui-san believes she's broken up with you and she's really troubled by you following her.

13:41.700 --> 13:42.380
What?

13:42.380 --> 13:44.310
That's a relief, I was able to say it.

13:44.310 --> 13:47.800
In other words, you've already been dumped, right?

13:48.420 --> 13:50.420
That can't be...

13:48.650 --> 13:50.420
Momoka-chan, you're correct.

13:51.140 --> 13:53.170
Well, I'll know for sure who's telling the truth

13:53.170 --> 13:57.560
once I complete my "You're dumped degree" test I learned in preschool.

13:57.930 --> 14:01.450
Do preschools on Earth teach things like that?

14:01.450 --> 14:03.940
Peach Tree Nursery is just a little too unique.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.940
Question One:

14:05.940 --> 14:09.810
Have you ever been rejected when you try and hug her?

14:12.360 --> 14:13.450
Yes...

14:13.450 --> 14:14.880
Question Two:

14:14.880 --> 14:18.870
Has she ever drawn a crayon line and informed you that you're not to cross that line?

14:19.300 --> 14:20.290
Yes...

14:20.290 --> 14:21.750
Question Three:

14:21.750 --> 14:24.760
Have you been hit over the head with a huge plate containing pudding?

14:25.070 --> 14:26.670
Y-Yes...

14:28.180 --> 14:32.200
I don't need to do any further checks. You've been dumped, Mister.

14:32.200 --> 14:36.680
Also, the degree of dumping was 283 times worse than usual.

14:37.030 --> 14:39.100
Impossible...

14:39.400 --> 14:40.600
All right, now's my chance.

14:40.850 --> 14:44.240
That's what I already told you, remember?  Rui-san really won't go out with you any more.

14:44.240 --> 14:46.330
No matter how much you chase her around, it's no use.

14:46.330 --> 14:47.180
That can't be...

14:47.180 --> 14:51.090
Oh? So, you're the type that chases girls, Mister?

14:51.090 --> 14:55.080
Didn't you know that the more persistently you chase them, the further they run?

14:55.080 --> 14:57.510
Further and further, all the way to the end of the universe!

14:57.510 --> 14:58.580
To the end of the universe...

14:58.880 --> 15:01.490
Why do I get the feeling this conversation just got exaggerated suddenly?

15:01.490 --> 15:03.670
It's just like last night's drama on TV.

15:05.640 --> 15:09.460
Rest assured, Ruu. We love each other from the bottom of our hearts.

15:09.460 --> 15:11.290
We'll be together, always.

15:16.670 --> 15:21.850
I had no idea that Rui felt that way...

15:26.540 --> 15:27.400
Teru-san.

15:27.400 --> 15:28.910
Please don't stop me.

15:29.480 --> 15:33.020
Sorry, I can't play tag with you right now.

15:38.100 --> 15:41.020
I received a thank you gift from Mikan-san for the interview...

15:44.590 --> 15:45.880
What?

15:50.900 --> 15:52.570
Miyu-chan, where did Teru go?

15:52.570 --> 15:54.680
Oh, you don't need to worry any more.

15:54.680 --> 15:57.950
I somehow managed to get him to understand and leave.

15:57.950 --> 15:58.820
No way...

15:58.820 --> 16:00.020
It's true.

16:00.020 --> 16:03.720
Although, I feel as though I might just have said a little too much...

16:03.720 --> 16:07.820
But I think that in the end it's best this way for Teru-san too.

16:07.820 --> 16:10.660
So, he really went back...

16:10.660 --> 16:11.240
What?

16:12.470 --> 16:15.240
I'm really relieved. Thank you, Miyu-chan.

16:16.440 --> 16:17.870
Ah, what?

16:20.020 --> 16:23.120
Rui-san doesn't look very happy.

16:23.120 --> 16:25.500
Hi, Miyu-chan! Wanya!

16:26.370 --> 16:27.600
I'm here to visit you again.

16:27.600 --> 16:28.940
Seiya-kun.

16:29.540 --> 16:31.530
I came here to buy Piki Pikis.

16:31.530 --> 16:34.020
It's a new product from the Heio City candy shop,

16:34.020 --> 16:36.010
and they're really popular back in Sharak right now.

16:36.330 --> 16:38.720
Oh? It sounds tasty.

16:39.070 --> 16:42.170
Oh, yeah. My sister and Teru-san are here, right?

16:42.170 --> 16:43.450
Ah... Um...

16:43.450 --> 16:45.720
They must've really startled you, Miyu-chan.

16:45.720 --> 16:47.440
But those two are always like that.

16:47.740 --> 16:48.730
Always?

16:49.110 --> 16:53.070
My sister always gets angry, yells "I'm breaking up with you," and runs away.

16:53.070 --> 16:54.660
Teru-san always chases after her,

16:54.660 --> 16:58.650
and in the end, they get back together and go home again. It's a pattern of theirs.

16:58.650 --> 17:00.100
A pattern?

17:00.100 --> 17:03.000
One can say they fight like cats and dogs, but in the end they'll still end up together.

17:03.000 --> 17:08.320
But wait, since Rui-san ran away all the way to Earth,

17:08.320 --> 17:10.800
doesn't it mean she definitely wants to break up this time?

17:11.140 --> 17:18.510
She's done this around 100 times already, so her friends nearby refuse to shelter her any more.

17:20.320 --> 17:21.760
What should we do?

17:21.760 --> 17:23.930
We never realized it would be something like this, and...

17:24.930 --> 17:28.230
What?! You made them break up for real this time?

17:28.230 --> 17:31.340
I thought I was helping Rui-san...

17:31.340 --> 17:33.320
Miss Meddlesome-who-jumps-to-conclusions.

17:33.900 --> 17:35.820
I've got no complaints...

17:36.160 --> 17:37.780
It's complete!

17:38.490 --> 17:44.150
This perfect finish... it's because my love for Kanata-kun is perfect.

17:44.150 --> 17:47.000
Well, let's slice this into smaller pieces...

17:47.000 --> 17:48.960
I-I can't do this!

17:49.280 --> 17:51.190
To slice something that's shaped like Kanata-kun's face...

17:51.190 --> 17:53.090
To slice, slice, slice, slice, slice...

17:53.090 --> 17:53.850
What should I do?!

17:58.300 --> 18:00.070
Ah! What should I do?!

18:00.070 --> 18:02.780
It's all my fault it turned out this way.

18:02.780 --> 18:06.270
Well, I can see how you'd get the wrong idea.

18:06.630 --> 18:10.520
Either way, I need to apologize to Teru-san and make him come back.

18:10.520 --> 18:15.370
Please take me to Teru-san's place in your UFO, Seiya-kun!

18:15.370 --> 18:16.860
That's something I can't...

18:20.080 --> 18:23.490
I'm sorry that Miyu's caused you so much trouble by jumping to conclusions.

18:23.810 --> 18:28.580
What? What are you talking about? I'm really relieved; she saved me.

18:30.500 --> 18:32.320
Your eyes are really hollow...

18:34.940 --> 18:36.380
Well... um...

18:37.450 --> 18:39.050
I was being selfish, wasn't I?

18:40.740 --> 18:44.240
I was being selfish in thinking that Teru wouldn't change his mind no matter how spoilt I acted.

18:44.240 --> 18:48.940
I've done a lot of mean things to Teru.

18:52.290 --> 18:54.270
I wonder if she's okay...

19:00.700 --> 19:05.780
Although I can't slice this apple pie, all I need to do is ask Kanata-kun to slice it for me.

19:05.780 --> 19:07.930
"What a perfect apple pie."

19:07.930 --> 19:10.320
"Kanata-kun, please eat up."

19:10.320 --> 19:13.440
"Oh, I can taste your love, Hanakomachi."

19:17.520 --> 19:18.090
What?

19:20.130 --> 19:23.470
Miyu-chan's getting friendly with another boy?

19:25.710 --> 19:28.680
Kanata-kun's with another girl?!

19:28.680 --> 19:31.660
"Kanata, I'm going out with him now."

19:31.660 --> 19:34.870
"Oh, what a coincidence, I've just started going out with her."

19:34.870 --> 19:38.740
"Really? We're truly cousins. We even think alike."

19:38.740 --> 19:40.150
"You're right, Miyu."

19:40.460 --> 19:44.780
And the two couples happily ring the wedding bells together.

19:45.910 --> 19:47.240
Fly away!

19:47.640 --> 19:49.870
What? Chris-chan?

19:50.240 --> 19:51.460
Hanakomachi!

19:51.920 --> 19:53.970
Chris onee-chan?!

19:53.970 --> 19:55.130
Wanya!

19:55.890 --> 19:57.340
Calm down, Hanakomachi.

20:09.640 --> 20:11.230
Rui, watch out!

20:12.230 --> 20:13.450
Teru-san!

20:13.450 --> 20:14.860
You're amazing, Teru-san!

20:17.090 --> 20:18.030
How's that?

20:18.340 --> 20:21.830
But my sister wasn't actually in any danger at all...

20:21.830 --> 20:24.660
Yeah, the bell flew that way.

20:30.440 --> 20:31.580
Teru!

20:35.060 --> 20:36.250
It's nothing.

20:40.000 --> 20:41.270
Teru, why are you here?

20:41.270 --> 20:43.030
Didn't you go back home?

20:43.030 --> 20:45.450
I only went back to tell them that I needed a few days off.

20:45.930 --> 20:50.100
I may need to chase you to the ends of the universe.

20:50.100 --> 20:51.640
Thus, I prepared myself for that possibility.

20:51.900 --> 20:53.310
To the ends of the universe?

20:53.310 --> 20:54.640
Yes.

20:54.640 --> 20:57.490
If you really are going to run away from me again,

20:57.490 --> 20:59.900
I figured I'd chase you to find out how you really felt.

20:59.900 --> 21:02.970
And that if you really wanted to break up with me,

21:02.970 --> 21:06.870
then I'd nobly give you up and wish for your happiness from afar.

21:07.220 --> 21:08.410
Teru...

21:08.800 --> 21:09.870
Teru!

21:13.030 --> 21:15.210
Just as I thought, you're lovey-dovey with me, Rui!

21:15.550 --> 21:16.750
I'm glad...

21:16.750 --> 21:19.460
I was really sure that he was dumped.

21:19.830 --> 21:22.340
I guess the world of love is deeper than I thought.

21:22.690 --> 21:24.100
Let's go home together.

21:24.100 --> 21:25.130
Yes.

21:25.490 --> 21:31.330
Ruu-kun, Pepo-kun, and the little girl on the tricycle, let's play tag when I next return.

21:32.400 --> 21:35.730
He invited me to play too, he's a nice guy after all.

21:35.730 --> 21:39.570
Oh, but next time you visit, please don't come in the middle of the night fighting.

21:40.920 --> 21:42.010
Bye!

21:42.010 --> 21:43.820
I'm sorry to have disturbed you all!

21:43.820 --> 21:45.090
I see...

21:45.090 --> 21:46.220
Bye...

21:46.220 --> 21:48.740
I came all this way, so I guess I'll stay here for a while.

21:51.660 --> 21:54.120
One problem solved... I guess.

21:55.400 --> 21:59.010
Did I really make this mess?!

21:59.010 --> 22:01.560
Oh, I'm sorry. I'm so...

22:03.130 --> 22:04.130
There we go.

22:04.130 --> 22:06.930
Let's leave the cleaning to Hanakomachi.

22:06.930 --> 22:08.640
Yup, she'll do a great job.

22:11.910 --> 22:15.390
Please could you cut this for me, Kanata-kun.

22:15.390 --> 22:16.550
Oh, sure...

22:16.550 --> 22:19.040
An apple pie shaped like Kanata-san's face?

22:19.040 --> 22:20.770
That's so like Chris-chan.

22:20.770 --> 22:22.230
But it looks really yummy.

22:23.440 --> 22:24.710
Yummy!

22:25.250 --> 22:27.350
On second thought, don't cut it!

22:29.130 --> 22:34.320
Kanata-kun's eating my perfect apple pie of love!

22:34.320 --> 22:35.950
This is kind of embarrassing!

22:37.370 --> 22:38.240
Was it good?

22:38.240 --> 22:39.830
Y-Yeah.

22:40.460 --> 22:41.960
I thought I'd die...

22:41.960 --> 22:43.780
You did eat the entire thing yourself.

22:43.780 --> 22:47.600
I couldn't exactly help it. She suddenly stuffed the entire pie into my mouth.

22:47.600 --> 22:49.350
Well, it was delicious, so whatever.

22:49.350 --> 22:52.500
Hanakomachi's good at baking.

22:52.500 --> 22:54.620
I'm sorry that I suck.

22:54.620 --> 22:56.260
Yeah, well you do suck.

22:56.260 --> 22:58.080
What did you say?! I can't believe this!

22:58.080 --> 22:59.590
Well, you said it yourself.

22:59.590 --> 23:00.540
I did not!

23:00.540 --> 23:01.270
You...

23:01.650 --> 23:07.590
Miyu-chan's exactly the same. I wonder why she couldn't understand my sister's feelings?

23:07.590 --> 23:08.400
You're right...

23:08.400 --> 23:09.700
Ah! Idiot! Idiot!

23:09.300 --> 23:11.190
Wanya's diary:

23:09.700 --> 23:10.870
Kanata, you're an idiot!

23:10.870 --> 23:12.630
Hey, cut it out already.

23:11.190 --> 23:14.930
Miyu-san and Kanata-san fight a lot too.

23:14.930 --> 23:18.950
Is it because they get along with each other so well?

24:29.940 --> 25:00.730
Next Episode

24:31.880 --> 24:35.020
Oh no! Shikada-san from Chris-chan's place saw Wanya's true form!

24:35.020 --> 24:37.330
It looks like he didn't actually see the transformation.

24:37.330 --> 24:38.230
Trick him, Wanya!

24:38.890 --> 24:40.070
Return the dangos.

24:40.070 --> 24:42.040
We should be fine around Shikada-san now.

24:42.040 --> 24:43.220
Isn't it a tad suspicious?

24:43.220 --> 24:46.490
Next time on Daa Daa Daa: Wanya vs. Shikada-san.

24:46.490 --> 24:49.780
It looks like we've lit the flames of pride in Wanya as a sitter-pet.

24:49.780 --> 24:51.510
I'll do it. I'll do it.

24:54.010 --> 25:00.850
Wanya vs. Shikada-san

24:55.340 --> 24:56.180
Ruu!

24:55.340 --> 24:56.180
Ruu-kun!
